+# Repair status — 19 October 2026
+
+## Verified
+
+Production build, ESLint, JavaScript type checking and 31 regression tests pass. Tests use mocked records and do not move money or alter customer data. Initial type checking had 458 errors. Dependency remediation reduced reported vulnerabilities from 22 to 12 (5 high, 5 moderate, 2 low); remaining changes require separate compatibility review.
+
+Repairs include UI prop types and SDK usage, persisted cart validation, bounded quantities, server catalogue/delivery/coupon repricing, ledger pagination and fail-closed validation, pending-debit accounting, unavailable mobile-money providers, honest refund failures, checkout submission guards, unique order numbers, verification-page HTML escaping and generic failure messages. Wallet update access is now admin-only. Hosted-card repricing accounts for the existing flow reserving stock before redirect; it does not claim to provide atomic inventory reservation.
+
+## Still unresolved
+
+- Base44 editor cannot fetch michelbuki14/congo-commerce1. Its GitHub connection must be restored before preview verification. No live checkout was verified.
+- Browser orderService still attempts privileged accounting and order updates. A complete service-role server checkout migration, with authenticated/session-scoped order retrieval, is required; existing permission failures were not worked around by opening access.
+- Wallet debit and withdrawal operations lack atomic cross-request locking/transactions. Idempotency keys alone do not enforce uniqueness. These flows are not production-certified by this repair.
+- Product/Coupon/Supplier/Content and notification permissions require a coordinated caller migration; wallet update access was restricted, but broader RLS cleanup is unfinished.
+- Payment webhook fulfillment reconciliation, payout eligibility and inventory/coupon reservation reconciliation need end-to-end verification.
+- Mobile-money gateway setup remains absent. Verification-link routing and expiry require separate validation.
+- Remaining dependency advisories need compatibility work.
+
+No Publish action was taken. Base44 sandbox backend and entity edits synchronize automatically. The pre-repair restore point is `Before October 19 verified repairs` (4fe2ff4ab431a0a723dd9dcbf326c629bce6c09b).
