+# UI repairs — 20 October 2026
+- Unified the legacy success route with the authorized order confirmation screen, removing unsupported mobile-money instructions.
+- Distinguished unpaid, paid and canceled states, corrected total and invoice labels, and added status refresh/retry.
+- Hid pickup codes on canceled orders and return actions until delivery.
+- Fixed seller-wallet loading without a seller, replaced name lookup with owner ID, surfaced load failures and prevented repeat submissions while pending.
+- Labeled withdrawal fields and payment choices; radio groups are isolated for mobile/desktop copies.
+- Added visible keyboard focus, skip navigation, reduced-motion support, current-page indication and safe-area spacing for navigation/action bars.
+- Checkout shows server error messages, disables unavailable totals and labels COD as ordering rather than immediate payment.
+
+Verification: frontend type check, lint, production build and 63 tests passed. No browser visual verification was completed; the previously observed Base44 GitHub preview connection problem remains a limitation. No Publish action was performed.
